    "detailed_description": "*ding-dong*<br />\r\nYou're playing at your friend's house when you hear the doorbell ring. <br />\r\nHis parents are coming home late today, so your friend has to go look.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0About the Game<br />\r\nThis is a horror game where you must escape while avoiding the enemy and collecting specified items. <br />\r\nThere are elements of being chased, but no jump scares (sudden loud noises or scary images).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe expected playtime is around 15 to 20 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 3 endings: BAD (Game Over), NORMAL, and TRUE.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game does not feature a progress-saving function (only mouse sensitivity and volume settings are saved).<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Controls<br />\r\nWASD: Move<br />\r\nL Shift: Sprint<br />\r\nE: Interact<br />\r\nEsc: Menu<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Regarding Video Streaming<br />\r\nStreaming and Let's Play videos are permitted without requiring permission.<br />\r\nIf possible, please include the game's name in the title of your stream or video, and include a link to the Steam page in the description.",
